<title>USA: Detroit Diesel Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Detroit Diesel Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					Three Months Ended  Years Ended</p>
<p>					December 31,    December 31,</p>
<p>				     1996     1995	1996     1995</p>
<p> Net revenues		   $505.2  $510.4  $1,962.9 $2,087.1</p>
<p> Cost of sales		   393.3   389.8   1,513.8  1,600.8</p>
<p> Gross profit		    111.9   120.6     449.1    486.3</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p> Selling and administrative   78.5    75.0     292.1    311.0</p>
<p> Research and development     27.1    27.0     105.2     94.8</p>
<p> Interest			    3.0     2.0	12.1	9.7</p>
<p> Special charge			-	 -	38.3	  -</p>
<p> Restructuring charge		-    10.0	   -     10.0</p>
<p>     Total			 108.6   114.0     447.7    425.5</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes  (1.3)     1.9     (3.0)     19.8</p>
<p> Minority interests		  -	.2	  .6	 .9</p>
<p> Net income			  4.6     4.5	 3.8     40.1</p>
<p> Primary net income per share  .19     .18	 .16     1.62</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 special charge consists of product coverage and reduction in the value of an investment in Mexico, representing $24.9 million or $1.01/share after tax.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
